<title>SPAIN: Spain 6-mo T-bill yield rises to 5.551 pct.</title>
<headline>Spain 6-mo T-bill yield rises to 5.551 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Spain announced the following results at Wednesday's Treasury debt auction (amounts bid, allocated in billions of pesetas):</p>
<p> ISSUE Yield   Pvs	Price    Pvs	Bid    Allocated 6-mo</p>
<p>	 5.551   5.351     97.27   97.38   76.465   64.065</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom, + 341 585 8340</p>
